    instructions: 'CHICKEN\\n=======\\n1. Season chicken breast with salt (and any AIP-safe seasonings).\\n2. Heat oil in a skillet over medium-high heat.\\n3. Cook chicken 6-7 minutes per side until internal temp reaches 165°F.\\n4. Let rest 5 minutes, then slice.\\n\\nVEGGIE MEDLEY\\n=============\\n1. Cook the entire bag of Birds Eye Steamfresh Broccoli, Cauliflower & Carrots on the stovetop: add to a pot with a splash of water, cover, and steam for about 11 minutes until tender.\\n2. Season with salt and a drizzle of oil if desired.',
