    instructions: '1. Mix ground turkey with salt, oregano, and basil. Form into 2 patties.\n\n2. Heat half the olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat.\n\n3. Cook patties 5-6 minutes per side until internal temp reaches 165°F.\n\n4. Remove patties and set aside.\n\n5. Add remaining oil to pan. Add cauliflower rice and broccoli.\n\n6. Sauté 6-8 minutes until vegetables are tender.\n\n7. Season vegetables with salt and serve with patties.\n\nMake extra patties for tomorrows lunch (leftover).\n\nMacros per serving:\n- Calories: ~680\n- Protein: 54g\n- Net Carbs: 10g\n- Fat: 24g',
