    instructions: '1. Season chicken breast with oregano, garlic powder, and salt.\n\n2. Heat 1 tbsp olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat.\n\n3. Cook chicken 6-7 minutes per side until internal temp reaches 165°F.\n\n4. Let chicken rest 5 minutes, then slice.\n\n5. Make the dressing: Whisk remaining 1 tbsp olive oil with lemon juice, a pinch of salt, and dried oregano.\n\n6. In a large bowl, combine romaine lettuce, cucumber, olives, red onion, parsley, and mint.\n\n7. Top with sliced chicken and avocado.\n\n8. Drizzle with lemon-olive oil dressing.\n\nFamily adaptation: Serve with pita bread, hummus, and feta cheese for the family. Add tzatziki sauce for them. Your bowl stays AIP-clean.\n\nMacros per serving:\n- Calories: ~720\n- Protein: 55g\n- Net Carbs: 8g\n- Fat: 48g',
